{"parse": {"title": "间隔月-04", "pageid": 101217, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88-03\" title=\"间隔月-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">间隔月-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88-05\" title=\"间隔月-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">间隔月</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.9D.A1.E8.9B.87.E8.AF.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"睡蛇说\">睡蛇说</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 睡蛇说</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">What the Snake Said</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>关卡后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_shuijiao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_shuijiao1\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_shuijiao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-2_7_at_shuijiao1.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_shuijiao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-2_7_at_shuijiao1.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_shuijiao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/Cg-2_7_at_shuijiao1.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_shuijiao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_siweidiantang\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_siweidiantang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_siweidiantang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这次会议讨论的是，我们即将前往普列谢茨克参与一个航天航空相关的项目研究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>研究内容大致可以被描述为——用传送术式往航天器上送补给。神秘学与科技的结合，很有潜力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>大家有什么意见的话，现在可发表了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅲ：</div><div>嘶嘶——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>一如既往，赛普内斯特弃权，还有谁想发表意见？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>这关联可比我想得要少。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅵ：</div><div>无生命体的传输是基石，鱼总得一口一口吃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>相当精妙的比喻，可惜过于贴近生活，导致偏离了主题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div>我就说生态缸里的鱼是小奶酪吃的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅵ：</div><div>不是我——是赛普内斯特，他多半又在训练他的狩猎技巧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……鱼的事可以晚点再说。现在言归正传，墨尼克说的正是我想说的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>如果物资补给可以通过传送术式送到航天器上，在这个研究基础上更进一步，或许我们就可以直接将生命体传送到太空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一根尾巴尖轻轻举了起来，小蛇们具备在选择立场前充分了解问题的美德。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅶ：</div><div>我上周才刚睡醒，有没有好心蛇能告诉我，普列谢茨克在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>简单来说，在莫斯科以北五百英里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>就在北极圈里！一阵风就能冻僵蛇的地方！冰天雪地，特别刺激！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>清晰有力的描述，令蛇无法反驳。冷周六决定说点什么，以挽回普列谢茨克在迪布瓦家的评价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但研究主要会在室内进行，恒温的室内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅲ：</div><div>嘶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div>赛普内斯特听起来好像不太喜欢那儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>北极圈？听起来真浪漫。简直想不到还有什么能比这更棒了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我们还是快速解决争议吧。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\"><img alt=\"2_7_bg_wenshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/600px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/900px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_bg_wenshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六从绿棱镜的项目计划书上醒来，转动着酸痛的脖子，为自己梦见过去的事感到不解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……昨天的睡眠时间果然不够，我甚至做了怪梦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>为什么不是你的潜意识在提醒你，我们应该重新进行一次正式表决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>作为一种意识活动，梦境也可以被共享意识的家人们轻易感知。虽然他们大部分时间不会这么做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你是说我们才进行过的那种吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div>说真的，我还是不明白，咱们有什么道理不答应她呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我会假设你正在讨论绿棱镜的项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>目前看来很有意思，也很有启发性，但不太前沿，侧重应用上的完善。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅵ：</div><div>我认为之前项目差点被裁撤的事应该被加入风险评估项。我很担心那不会是唯一一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我向来不赞同用一个问题来解决另一个问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>星光并不总会照在我们的前路上，西尔维，它更喜欢躲在云层里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-633701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅵ：</div><div>看来上次的会议并没有达成我们想要的一致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幸而这在迪布瓦家虽然不常见，但也不算罕见。毕竟不是每次都能凑到奇数条醒着的蛇进行有效投票。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>根据过往的经验，在无法取得共识的时候立刻展开新的互相说服，对现状不会有帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我们应该放松一下，吃点东西，整理思绪。我提议，下次会议推迟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>迪布瓦们像热爱美食一样热爱理性，所以提议通过。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>众所周知，如果在餐厅不够密集的地方工作，外出就餐的时候就很容易遇到熟人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>冷周六女士，没想到会在这里遇见您。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>考虑到附近餐馆的分布和我们对食物的爱好，遇到的概率可不低。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>开玩笑的，这真是令人高兴——两个人一起的话，就可以多点个菜了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>罐焖牛肉看起来很不错，或者你有什么想试试？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我很愿意陪您尝尝这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>那就要这个，这个，还要一个罐焖牛肉。谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-634001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-634001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-634001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">餐馆老板：</div><div>当然可以，老尤里一定会让你们吃得饱饱的，可爱的姑娘们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>北方哨歌还没有来接她宝贵的学徒吗？我还以为她已经为你在拉普拉斯找到了一份合适的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>北方哨歌女士确实是这样说的，但她临时接到了一个邀请，要去“帮点小忙”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我会在这里等她过来。那么，您呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我是说，您之后有什么样的打算呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-634001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-634001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-634001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">餐馆老板：</div><div>你们的烤面包和奶油鱼汤，快趁热吃吧姑娘们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>谢谢您，这看起来棒极了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-634001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-634001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-634001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">餐馆老板：</div><div>这可是老尤里最擅长的菜，可别忘记用你的面包蘸一蘸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小宇航员对这样热情友好的命令从来没有抵抗力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/HeadIconSmall-311713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>唔……非常好吃！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>热情的老尤里直到此刻才满足地离开了餐桌边，显然对这句夸赞期待已久。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_canguanhuitan1\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_canguanhuitan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>尝起来不错。在变化的事儿太多了，幸亏好味道总会留下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六看向旁边，女孩正用汤匙在鱼汤上轻轻画圈。显然，库珀花环也怀念曾经的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我想我可以提供一点情感支持，让你不这么难受。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我没有……呃，我是说，很感谢您？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩的赞同更多出于礼貌的惯性。她不会戳穿，她从那双细长的瞳孔中看到了某种跃跃欲试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>众所周知，我们观测到的许多星光都来自于百亿光年之外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>当我们看见它的时候，散发光亮的那颗星球本身可能早就已经坍缩了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但落在你瞳孔中的星光无疑属于此刻。也就是说，那颗星球，它在你的眼中延续了早已消逝的生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>这听起来……很浪漫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>或许是吧，浪漫。你的眼睛，你的记忆，乃至于你的存在本身，就是另一些生命的延续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>所以别太难过——你将见证他们，正如他们曾见证你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>听上去像一首诗。谢谢你，冷周六女士，我……我只是还没完全习惯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我会记得您的话，我会努力的……去延续他们，见证他们。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六满意地点头，悄悄把这归档进了为同事提供情感支撑的成功案例里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>下次再被指责无法合理关注和安抚朋友们的情绪时，这一定会是很好的论据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>注意力和面包一起浸回鱼汤里，直到被库珀花环的轻笑重新舀起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>无意冒犯，我只是没想过，您还会有这么浪漫诗意的一面。您好像说过，对浪漫过敏？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>共享意识的意思就是，如果我现在阅读乔叟的诗而二号在读广义相对论，我们九个都会同时获取这两部分的知识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显然，为了不破坏冷周六刻意营造的氛围，小蛇已经隐忍许久。现在，它终于找到了合适的开口时机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>是的，很好用，指针羡慕极了。不过我不经常想起来使用我被分享的……关于文学和哲学的那部分。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>严谨地说这并不代表我从不阅读诗集，我会在不需要工作的时候用这个放松一下大脑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>一种有效的训练，意象堆叠、情感漫漶的诗歌可以让我对逻辑和理性更敏感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>我不允许你这样说，诗歌可是人类文明史上最璀璨的宝石！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>那位你最欣赏的诗人艾略特就曾说过，他心目中的理想读者应该从未受过教育。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我想他或许会对我很满意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我们无从得知艾略特的反应，但显然，就在此时此地，有蛇很不满意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311614.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311614.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/HeadIconSmall-311614.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311614.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>嘿，八号，你为什么要咬她？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-633705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅷ：</div><div>当然是因为愤怒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div>好痛！这可是大家的身体！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅳ：</div><div>呜……发生什么了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这样突然爆发的家庭矛盾不算常见。女孩花了很大的力气才把小蛇们分开，以免影响就餐秩序。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这个小小的插曲让她错失了最好的提问机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但那一点点好奇仍然萦绕在女孩心头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-311711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>所以，您会接受绿棱镜女士的邀请吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "间隔月-04"}}